# StarWall logo

The official StarWall mark is the chrome hex badge supplied by AGRON.

- Web UI, header, footer, login, and CORE map: `public/starwall-logo.webp` (AVIF sibling `starwall-logo.avif`).
- PDF, PNG fallback: `public/SW3.png`.
- Favicon / Apple: `public/favicon-32.png`, `public/apple-touch-icon.png`.
- Open Graph / Twitter: `public/og-starwall.jpg`.

Regenerate with `node scripts/optimize-logo.mjs <source.png>`.

- Do not redraw the wordmark in CSS or SVG.
- Do not generate a replacement logo.
- Do not switch to another mark.
